@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/terrace#> .
@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix sensing: <http://example.org/orexis/sensing#> .
@prefix prediction: <http://example.org/orexis/prediction#> .

<> a orexis:SelfGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is

#  WHO THIS AGENT IS: the agent acting for the terrace bed, and this document is its own by the self
#  it states. Booted as "terrace", the agent checks that this is so.
#
#  WHAT IT RUNS: it observes the bed's probe and the forecast and foresees them, and wants nothing,
#  so it is no planner and no executor; an observer is a deliberator too, so what its percepts are of is concluded.

:terrace_agent a orexis:Self , sensing:Observer , prediction:Predictor .
